// Cup of Joe Standard Library Showcase
Joe calls for std.math.
Joe calls for std.strings.
Joe calls for std.collections.
Joe calls for std.json.

Joe yells "=== Cup of Joe Showcase ===".

// Math
Joe remembers pi_approx as std.math.round(std.math.pi * 100) / 100.
Joe yells "Approximation of Pi: " + pi_approx.

// Strings
Joe remembers sentence as "   joe contemplates existence   ".
Joe remembers trimmed as std.strings.trim(sentence).
Joe remembers excited as std.strings.to_upper(trimmed) + "!".
Joe yells "Excited Joe: " + excited.

// Collections
Joe remembers grocery as ["beans", "water", "sugar"].
std.collections.push(grocery, "more beans").
Joe yells "Grocery list has " + len(grocery) + " items: " + grocery.

// JSON
Joe remembers profile_json as "{\"name\": \"Joe\", \"status\": \"sleepy\"}".
Joe remembers profile as std.json.parse(profile_json).
Joe yells "Profile status: " + profile.status.
